/Q7468901","priority":5,"questId":74689,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":746890101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2023160026,"text":"（先生の言ってた、金髪の旅人と空を飛ぶ白い妖精って…この人たちかな…）","nextNodeIds":[746890102]},{"nodeId":746890102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2419078706,"text":"なんだ？さっきからブツブツ…オイラたちの顔になにかついてるか？","nextNodeIds":[746890103]},{"nodeId":746890103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1005104194,"text":"あっ！ご、ごめんなさい！悪気はなかったんです！ただ…その…","nextNodeIds":[746890104,746890105]},{"nodeId":746890104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":209353882,"text":"落ち着いて、ゆっくり話して。","nextNodeIds":[746890106]},{"nodeId":746890106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":4125460762,"text":"#えっと…私はニネットと言う者なんですが、師匠のレピーヌ・ポーリーン先生が言ってたんです。伝説の冒険者{NICKNAME}さんは、最高の相棒パイモンさんとご一緒だと…！","nextNodeIds":[746890107]},{"nodeId":746890107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2363552226,"text":"お二人のことですよね…？まさか、本当にお会いできるなんて…","nextNodeIds":[746890108]},{"nodeId":746890108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3720458002,"text":"おおっ！レピーヌ・ポーリーンの弟子か！あいつ、最近うまくやってるみたいだな。","nextNodeIds":[746890109]},{"nodeId":746890109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1113919954,"text":"はい！先生のおかげで、私は人生の底から這い上がれたんです。","nextNodeIds":[746890110]},{"nodeId":746890110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":614743674,"text":"いったい何があったの…？","nextNodeIds":[746890111]},{"nodeId":746890111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":3548733810,"text":"私、以前は別の方に写真を教わっていまして…","nextNodeIds":[746890112]},{"nodeId":746890112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1353782698,"text":"一人前のカメラマンになれるよう、貯金を全部つぎ込んで、当時、一番高価だった撮影設備一式を買い揃えたんですよ。","nextNodeIds":[746890113]},{"nodeId":746890113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":3471686746,"text":"先生からも悪くない腕だと言われて…いい写真さえ撮れれば、必ずお金を稼げると思ってました。","nextNodeIds":[746890114]},{"nodeId":746890114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2251274514,"text":"でも…でも私、街に出ていざ人を目の前にすると緊張しちゃって、一言も話せなくなっちゃうんです。","nextNodeIds":[746890115]},{"nodeId":746890115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1458817714,"text":"「こんにちは、写真撮影はいかがですか？」…そう声をかけたいのに、言葉が詰まって、どうしても出てこなくて…","nextNodeIds":[746890116]},{"nodeId":746890116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2456758130,"text":"結局、お客さんたちはみんな、積極的で話し上手なカメラマンの方へ行ってしまいました。","nextNodeIds":[746890117]},{"nodeId":746890117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":4014579994,"text":"その後、モラもほとんど底をついて…大切な写真機を売って生活費に充てようかとまで考えました。","nextNodeIds":[746890118]},{"nodeId":746890118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2678609642,"text":"大変だったんだね。","nextNodeIds":[746890119]},{"nodeId":746890119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1186183762,"text":"レピーヌ・ポーリーン先生と出会ったのは、そんな時でした。","nextNodeIds":[746890120]},{"nodeId":746890120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2912691826,"text":"先生は私の機材と写真を見て、励ましてくれて…新しいレンズのテストも手伝わせてくださったんです。","nextNodeIds":[746890121]},{"nodeId":746890121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":4084125794,"text":"…私の撮った写真には、他の人にはない静けさと優しさがあるって言ってくれたんです。","nextNodeIds":[746890122]},{"nodeId":746890122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":705140602,"text":"だから！師匠がこの「瞬影」レンズの開発に成功した時、私は誰よりも喜びました！","nextNodeIds":[746890123]},{"nodeId":746890123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4020998794,"text":"「瞬影」レンズ？どんなレンズなんだ？","nextNodeIds":[746890124]},{"nodeId":746890124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":4067222450,"text":"高速で動く人物の姿勢や表情を鮮明に捉えられるんですよ！","nextNodeIds":[746890125]},{"nodeId":746890125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":3507239658,"text":"今はテストの最終段階なんですが…性能検証として、実地で大量のデータを収集しないといけません。","nextNodeIds":[746890126]},{"nodeId":746890126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":1662071402,"text":"先生はずっとお忙しいので、この仕事は私に任せてくださいました。そこで、テストに付き合ってくださる方を探して、手伝ってもらおうとしたんですが…","nextNodeIds":[746890127]},{"nodeId":746890127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2331197842,"text":"でも…でもまた、いつもの癖が出ちゃって。知らない人に声をかけようとすると、緊張で言葉が出てこなくなっちゃうんです…","nextNodeIds":[746890128]},{"nodeId":746890128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":3532054786,"text":"みんな怪訝な目で私を見てました。きっと、怪しい人だと思われたんだと思います…数日経つのに、結局まだ手伝ってくれる人は見つかっていません。","nextNodeIds":[746890129]},{"nodeId":746890129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":242966322,"text":"うぅっ…こんなことすらできないなんて、私って本当にダメ人間…","nextNodeIds":[746890130]},{"nodeId":746890130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2326402346,"text":"わわっ、泣くなよ…！頑張ったんだろ？お前も…","nextNodeIds":[746890131]},{"nodeId":746890131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":272425058,"text":"知らない人にいきなり頼み事をするのって、難しいよな。","nextNodeIds":[746890132,746890133]},{"nodeId":746890132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1559598338,"text":"自分を責めないで。努力はしたんだから。","nextNodeIds":[746890134]},{"nodeId":746890134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3484409154,"text":"#そうだぞ！{NICKNAME}なら撮影の腕もピカイチだし、大陸中に友達がいるから、モデルを見つけるのなんか朝飯前だぜ！","nextNodeIds":[746890135]},{"nodeId":746890135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":3130175586,"text":"ほ、本当ですか？て…手伝ってくださるんですか？","nextNodeIds":[746890136]},{"nodeId":746890136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":176056834,"text":"わぁ——！本当に、本当にありがとうございます！","nextNodeIds":[746890137]},{"nodeId":746890137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":138598354,"text":"「瞬影」レンズを搭載した特製の写真機をお渡ししますね！","nextNodeIds":[746890138]},{"nodeId":746890138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","textMapHash":2932316538,"text":"どうか、お友達の一番いきいきとした、その人らしい瞬間を撮ってきてください！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":746890133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1517357922,"text":"#それに、{M#俺}{F#私}たちが手伝えると思う。","nextNodeIds":[746890134]},{"nodeId":746890105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1718466362,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}のこと、知ってるの？","nextNodeIds":[746890106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7468901,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30920"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7468901],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30920,"speakerName":"ニネット","count":26},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":6},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw